==Evaluation==
;Pros
*Does decent damage in melee.
*Can inflict [[cripple]], [[burning]] and [[cracked armor]] to enemies around him.
*Possesses [[energy management]] and a [[self-heal]].
*Foes hit with [[Reaper's Sweep]] can be [[knocked down]] and when combined with [[Rending Aura]] can remove [[enchantment]]s.
*[[Banishing Strike]] and [[Heart of Holy Flame]] are extremely potent against [[summoned creature]]s and [[undead]] enemies.
*Possesses an [[IAS]]
;Cons
*Less effective against mobs with strong [[enchantment removal]].
*No [[hex]] or [[condition]] removal.
*No defensive skills.

==Dialogue==
;Towns and outposts:
:''"Do you hear the wind singing against the blade of my scythe? Do you know why the wind sings? It sings because it remembers who we were, and knows who we will be. It sees me in my childhood by the Istani sea. It remembers me on the day of my death in Vabbi. How do I know these things? Since the day I watched [[Kormir]] born, I have learned to listen."''

;Throne of Secrets:
:''"The wind speaks of your victory. All Elona whispers your name."''

