==Notes==
* Gehraz took care of [[Kormir]] while she was growing up.
* After Gehraz spared his life, [[Abasi]] repaid [[Istan]] by becoming a Sunspear.
* Wears a reskinned version of the [[Dervish Elite Sunspear armor]] colored in a very bright pattern.

==Trivia==
* Gehraz's line ''"Fly, you fools!"'' is said by Gandalf in ''The Lord Of The Rings: The Fellowship Of The Ring''.
* Gehraz's line ''"Into each life, some pain must fall."'' is a reference to song ''Into Each Life Some Rain Must Fall'' by [[W:The Ink Spots#In popular culture|The Ink Spots and Ella Fitzgerald]].
* Gehraz was one of three henchmen in Nightfall who did not have an [[elite skill]] at level 20. This [[Talk:List of Nightfall henchmen#Elite skills for Odurra, Gehraz and Aidan in Nightfall|was intentional]], but was changed after the [[Game updates/20081113|13 November 2008]] game update. (The other 2 henchmen were [[Aidan]] and [[Odurra]].) 
* His skills were changed as part of the [[Feedback:Game updates/20091022|22nd October 2009 update]] and the [[Feedback:Game updates/20110217|17th February 2011 Dervish update]]. 
** 2009 Update: This added [[Attacker's Insight]], [[Conviction]], [[Heart of Holy Flame]], [[Mystic Regeneration]], and [[Victorious Sweep]], and removed [[Dust Cloak]], [[Eremite's Attack]], [[Reap Impurities]], [[Signet of Pious Light]], and [[Vital Boon]] from his skills. 
** 2011 Update: This added [[Banishing Strike]], [[Eremite's Zeal]], [[Heart of Fury]], [[Rending Aura]], and [[Twin Moon Sweep]], and removed [[Aura of Thorns]], [[Attacker's Insight]], [[Conviction]], [[Mystic Regeneration]], and [[Victorious Sweep]] from his skills. 
* Wields a [[Suntouched Scythe]]. 

